\newlabel{fig:rsvp-funnel}{{6.1}{22}{The archive as a tabletop RSVP system. Ingestion ($\eta $) deposits unexplained structure density $\Phiv $; the rematching flow $\vv $ transports it through channels priced by the admissibility constraint surface; the rate operator $\Gamma $ crushes it into crystallized code $\Sv $. On a plateau $\Gamma $ vanishes with $\Phiv > 0$ --- the ontological deficit in field form. An \textsc {Admit} removes a bottleneck and the trapped mass funnels through as a shock front: a collapse event}{figure.6.1}{}}
